Source: kalinka-server
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Dmitry Savin <envelsavinds@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 9)
Standards-Version: 3.9.6
Homepage: https://github.com/madenvel/KalinkaPlayer
Package: kalinka-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: python3 (>= @PYTHON_VERSION@), python3 (<< @PYTHON_VERSION_UPPER@),
    python3-venv,
    python3-pip,
    python3-setuptools,
    kalinka-plugin-sdk (>= 1.0), kalinka-plugin-sdk (<< 2),
    libcurlpp0,
    libcurl4,
    libflac++10,
    libflac12,
    libasound2,
    libspdlog1.10,
    libfmt9,
    libstdc++6,
    libc6,
    libgcc-s1,
    libnghttp2-14,
    libidn2-0,
    libssl3,
    libgssapi-krb5-2,
    zlib1g,
    libogg0,
    libunistring2,
    libkrb5-3,
    libk5crypto3,
    libcom-err2,
    libkrb5support0,
    libkeyutils1,
    libselinux1,
    libpcre2-8-0
Description: Kalinka Music Player (server)
  Kalinka Music Player service used in a pair with Kalinka App.
